<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_strike_intensity" target="energy_maritime_chokepoi::maritime_security_risk" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher rates of missile, artillery and drone strikes near coasts and on naval/port targets produce more direct attacks, mines and collateral damage to shipping, increasing the frequency and severity of hostile incidents on sea lanes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">energy_maritime_chokepoi</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_strike_intensity" target="energy_maritime_chokepoi::crude_export_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Kinetic strikes that damage export infrastructure (ports, loading terminals, storage tanks, pipelines) or render berths unusable directly reduce the volume of crude that can be loaded and exported.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">energy_maritime_chokepoi</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_strike_intensity" target="iran_proxy_escalation::foreign_military_presenc" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid spike in high-intensity kinetic operations in Ukraine forces NATO/US to reassign maritime and air assets to Europe for deterrence and logistics, reducing the pool of forces available for forward presence in the Iran-proxies theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_strike_intensity" target="north_korea_missiles::escalation_pressure" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">High-intensity, large-scale missile and strike operations in Ukraine normalize massed long-range fires and damage thresholds, prompting North Korea to increase readiness, threat-posturing and pre-emptive signaling that raise escalation pressure on the Korean peninsula.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">north_korea_missiles</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_strike_intensity" target="us_china_tech_trade::ai_capital_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in intense kinetic operations increase perceived demand for ISR, autonomy and defense technology, prompting private and strategic investors to reallocate capital into AI firms and funds positioned to supply those capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
