  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">An increased rate of hostile actions against vessels directly raises the frequency and severity of incidents experienced by commercial shipping, thereby increasing measured maritime security risk.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
