  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A stepped-up presence of external militaries in the Iran-proxy theater generates domestic political pressure and security assessments that prompt governments (especially the US and its allies) to tighten export controls, vetting, and sanctions on dual-use technologies implicated in the theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
