  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher rates of rerouting, delays, seizures and port interruptions directly reduce the volume of crude that can be loaded and shipped on schedule, lowering crude export flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
