  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Disruption to commercial shipping raises energy and food prices and supply bottlenecks in donor countries and in Ukraine, triggering public unrest and political pressure that erodes government stability and sustained public support for continued involvement in the Ukraine war.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
