  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in accessible high‑end compute dedicated to allied ISR, targeting analysis and air‑defense simulation shortens detection-to-intercept cycles and strengthens deterrence, reducing the frequency of DPRK cross‑border attacks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
