  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Unilateral tightening of AI export controls or cross-border tech rules by the US/allies produces compliance divergences and friction with partners (commercial and policy), degrading synchronized intelligence-sharing and joint deterrence posture.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
