  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased arms shipments and related parts through regional logistics routes lead to interdictions, targeted sanctions and supply-chain disruptions that interrupt deliveries of high-end chips and leased compute hardware, reducing accessible compute capacity in affected markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
